{"_id":"8f4b22ddba37a3c8","name":"Adventurer’s Pack","type":"equipment","img":"icons/tools/smithing/anvil.webp","system":{"category":"Adventuring Gear","description":"A compact kit with the usual travel necessities.","cost":50,"availability":"Common","bulk":0.1,"prosthetic":false,"effectsText":"A compact kit with the usual travel necessities.","specialRules":"This bag contains all of the necessary tools and items an adventurer would need for travel, that being a canteen, rope, flint and steel, etc. ◆ Light bulk (1/10) Alchemy Kit This small box contains everything an alchemist needs to practice their craft. Required to use the Alchemy skill. Failing an Alchemy check by 5 or more while using this item moves it -1 step on the the Break Gauge. ◆ 1 bulk. Bait This enticing mixture makes animals more agreeable. When used, beasts are treated as 1 step friendlier when making a Persuasion check. This item is consumed when used. ◆ Light bulk (1/10) Magick Bag This bag is far more spacious on the inside than it would appear. Grants +10 bulk while in your inventory. ◆ Light bulk (1/10) 137 :7 retpahC egapiuqE"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
