{"_id":"26cdf694627c677c","name":"Survival Kit","type":"equipment","img":"icons/tools/smithing/anvil.webp","system":{"category":"Adventuring Gear","description":"Supplies for wilderness Survival tasks.","cost":200,"availability":"Common","bulk":1,"prosthetic":false,"effectsText":"Supplies for wilderness Survival tasks.","specialRules":"This pack contains a number of items and supplies one would need for exploring the wilds. Required for some aspects of the Survival skill. ◆ 1 bulk. Tent A large tent, fit for a small party of adventurers. Provides up to 4 characters with appropriate shelter needed to gain natural healing while in the wild. ◆ 1 bulk. Thieves’ Tools Any thief worth his weight in stolen goods has a set of these. Required to use the Disable skill. Failing a Disable check by 5 or more while using this item moves it -1 step on the the Break Gauge. ◆ Light bulk (1/10) MMOOUUNNTTSS"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
